{
    "title": "Sheriff Labrador's Safety Tips",
    "description": "BabyBus combines the popular cartoon character Sheriff Labrador with a game and launches a new children's safety education app, Sheriff Labrador's Safety Tips! It is dedicated to cultivating children's safety awareness and improving their self-protection abilities in a fun and educational way. All parents and children are welcome to join in this fun-filled learning journey!\r\n\r\nCOMPREHENSIVE SAFETY KNOWLEDGE\r\nThis app covers three major safety fields: Home Safety, Outdoor Safety, and Disaster Response. It includes a wide range of topics, from \"preventing burns from hot food\" and \"staying safe in the car\" to \"earthquake and fire escape\". It will help kids raise their safety awareness from a variety of perspectives.\r\n\r\nRICH LEARNING METHODS\r\nTo make learning about safety more engaging and less boring, we've designed four fun teaching modules: interactive games, safety cartoons, safety stories, and parent-child quizzes. These fun content will not only allow kids to learn about everyday safety while having fun but also help them acquire basic self-rescue skills!\r\n\r\nPOPULAR CARTOON STAR\r\nSheriff Labrador, who is popular for his wealth of safety knowledge, will be kids' learning partner! He is not only full of courage and wisdom but also very friendly and lively. With him, safety learning will be exciting! In a joyful atmosphere, kids can learn how to protect themselves easily!\r\n\r\nAre you still worried about your kid's safety education? Sheriff Labrador is here to help your kid learn about safety and master self-rescue skills! Let's help them grow up safely!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- 53 fun games that simulate real-life scenarios to enhance children's awareness of dangers;\r\n- 60 episodes of safety cartoons and 94 safety stories to teach kids about safety in a vivid way;\r\n- The parent-kid quiz allows parents and kids to learn together and promotes their communication;\r\n- Games, cartoons, and stories are updated every week;\r\n- Supports offline play;\r\n- Supports setting time limits to prevent kids from getting addicted!",
    "descriptionHTML": "BabyBus combines the popular cartoon character Sheriff Labrador with a game and launches a new children&#39;s safety education app, Sheriff Labrador&#39;s Safety Tips! It is dedicated to cultivating children&#39;s safety awareness and improving their self-protection abilities in a fun and educational way. All parents and children are welcome to join in this fun-filled learning journey!<br><br>COMPREHENSIVE SAFETY KNOWLEDGE<br>This app covers three major safety fields: Home Safety, Outdoor Safety, and Disaster Response. It includes a wide range of topics, from &quot;preventing burns from hot food&quot; and &quot;staying safe in the car&quot; to &quot;earthquake and fire escape&quot;. It will help kids raise their safety awareness from a variety of perspectives.<br><br>RICH LEARNING METHODS<br>To make learning about safety more engaging and less boring, we&#39;ve designed four fun teaching modules: interactive games, safety cartoons, safety stories, and parent-child quizzes. These fun content will not only allow kids to learn about everyday safety while having fun but also help them acquire basic self-rescue skills!<br><br>POPULAR CARTOON STAR<br>Sheriff Labrador, who is popular for his wealth of safety knowledge, will be kids&#39; learning partner! He is not only full of courage and wisdom but also very friendly and lively. With him, safety learning will be exciting! In a joyful atmosphere, kids can learn how to protect themselves easily!<br><br>Are you still worried about your kid&#39;s safety education? Sheriff Labrador is here to help your kid learn about safety and master self-rescue skills! Let&#39;s help them grow up safely!<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- 53 fun games that simulate real-life scenarios to enhance children&#39;s awareness of dangers;<br>- 60 episodes of safety cartoons and 94 safety stories to teach kids about safety in a vivid way;<br>- The parent-kid quiz allows parents and kids to learn together and promotes their communication;<br>- Games, cartoons, and stories are updated every week;<br>- Supports offline play;<br>- Supports setting time limits to prevent kids from getting addicted!",
    "summary": "Follow the cartoon and learn about safety with Sheriff Labrador!",
